   "meta": {
    "application": "BambuStudio-02.00.00.98",
    "profile_title": "Efficient - Reduced Print Time Cascade Connect",
    "profile_notes": "REMAINING CASCADE CONNECT PLATES ADDED — DRASTICALLY REDUCED PRINT TIME Total print time has been reduced by potentially 6 + hours through slicer optimization rather than aggressive speed increases. Actual speed values (mm/s) were not significantly raised, and in some cases were reduced. Most gains came from slicer settings that better complement the model’s geometry and curvature. Below is Plate 1 as a representative example of the changes made. BASE Over 1 hour removed from print time using a more efficient base profile. Why this profile is faster: Changed “Only one wall on top surfaced” from “Top Surfaces” to “Top Most Surface” Prevents slow, forced narrow infill from being applied to every stepped section of the internal bin incline This change alone can save 30+ minutes of print time Added infill modifiers to reduce bridge time in thin, sparse infill regions Optimized line widths Switched to rectilinear infill at a lower percentage to reduce both time and filament usage Additional minor slicer refinements Other Notes Overall speed was reduced , not increased (Some speeds were slightly raised later; original values may differ) No acceleration increases 3 walls retained Structural strength remained a priority Reduced total filament usage Similar optimizations were applied to the Board and Pieces , resulting in a substantial overall reduction in print time without sacrificing strength or print reliability.",
